These icons are from Tabler Icons (https://tabler.io/icons), MIT-licensed.

The SVG path data is the genuine @tabler/icons vector data (matching the Claude
Design pages this UI reproduces). Files are wrapped in the standard Tabler envelope
(24x24 viewBox, fill=none, stroke=currentColor, stroke-width=2, round caps/joins);
the loader (src/display/icons.py) substitutes the stroke color and raster size.

